@startuml
participant User
participant "GPT-4o (DB Query Generator)" as DBQueryGen
participant PostgreSQL
participant "GPT-4o (SQL Verifier)" as SQLVerifier
participant "GPT-4o (Tweet Rewriter)" as TweetRewriter
participant Python

User -> Python: Start processing an event
Python -> DBQueryGen: Generate SQL to retrieve relevant past games
DBQueryGen -> Python: Returns SQL Query
Python -> PostgreSQL: Execute SQL Query
PostgreSQL -> Python: Returns relevant past games

Python -> SQLVerifier: Generate SQL to verify if event matches tweet template
SQLVerifier -> Python: Returns SQL Verification Query
Python -> PostgreSQL: Execute SQL Verification Query
PostgreSQL -> Python: Returns True/False

alt If False (Event does not match template)
    Python -> User: "No valid match found."
else If True (Event matches template)
    Python -> TweetRewriter: Generate rewritten tweet with actual event data
    TweetRewriter -> Python: Returns rewritten tweet
    Python -> User: Displays the final corrected tweet
end
@enduml